cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MethylSeg, please cite this software."
title: "MethylSeg"
type: software
abstract: >-
  MethylSeg is a context-aware methylome segmentation method for identifying
  partially methylated domains in whole-genome bisulfite sequencing and
  methylation microarray data.
